---
// Archivo: src/pages/mediscribe/index.astro
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const title = "VitalScribe AI | El Asistente Clínico Definitivo - Pixelarte Studio";
const APP_URL = "https://vitalscribeai.com/";
---

<Layout title={title}>
  
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-slate-900 pt-20 pb-32 lg:pt-32 lg:pb-40">
    <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-[500px] h-[500px] bg-teal-500 rounded-full mix-blend-overlay filter blur-[100px] opacity-20 -translate-y-1/2 translate-x-1/2"></div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-[500px] h-[500px] bg-indigo-500 rounded-full mix-blend-overlay filter blur-[100px] opacity-20 translate-y-1/2 -translate-x-1/2"></div>
    
    <div class="relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-teal-500/10 border border-teal-500/20 text-teal-300 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-8">
        <span class="relative flex h-2 w-2">
          <span class="animate-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-teal-400 opacity-75"></span>
          <span class="relative inline-flex rounded-full h-2 w-2 bg-teal-500"></span>
        </span>
        Motor Neural Clínico v4.0 Activo
      </div>

      <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white mb-6">
        Recupera tu tiempo con <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-teal-400 to-cyan-200">Inteligencia Clínica</span>
      </h1>
      
      <p class="text-xl text-slate-300 max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-10 leading-relaxed">
        VitalScribe no solo transcribe; estructura, analiza y redacta tu nota médica bajo norma NOM-004 en segundos. Enfócate en el paciente, nosotros cuidamos el expediente.
      </p>

      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center items-center">
        <a href={APP_URL} target="_blank" class="w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-4 bg-teal-500 hover:bg-teal-400 text-slate-900 font-bold rounded-xl transition-all shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(20,184,166,0.3)] flex items-center justify-center gap-2 hover:-translate-y-1">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zM9.555 7.168A1 1 0 008 8v4a1 1 0 001.555.832l3-2a1 1 0 000-1.664l-3-2z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
            Probar Gratis Ahora
        </a>
        <a href="#demo-funcional" class="w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-4 bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 border border-white/10 text-white font-medium rounded-xl transition-all backdrop-blur-sm">
          Ver demostración
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="demo-funcional" class="py-24 bg-slate-50 relative">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      
      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-teal-100 text-teal-600 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl shadow-sm mb-6">🧠</div>
          <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">Comprensión Médica Profunda</h2>
          <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 mb-8">
            Nuestra IA distingue entre síntomas, diagnósticos y plan terapéutico. Transforma una conversación natural en un documento legal estructurado.
          </p>

          <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-lg relative overflow-hidden">
            <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-1 h-full bg-blue-500"></div>
            <div class="flex gap-4">
              <div class="flex-1">
                <p class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase mb-2">Tu Dictado Natural:</p>
                <p class="text-slate-800 italic mb-4">"Paciente con dolor lumbar de 3 días, EVA 7/10. Vamos a iniciar Ketorolaco sublingual y reposo relativo..."</p>
                
                <div class="h-px bg-slate-100 w-full my-4"></div>

                <p class="text-xs font-bold text-teal-600 uppercase mb-2 flex items-center gap-1">
                  <svg class="w-3 h-3" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"/></svg>
                  Estructura VitalScribe (SOAP):
                </p>
                <div class="bg-slate-50 p-3 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 font-mono text-xs md:text-sm text-slate-700">
                  <span class="text-blue-600 font-bold">SUBJETIVO:</span> Lumbalgia aguda (3 días evol), EVA 7/10.<br/>
                  <span class="text-blue-600 font-bold">PLAN:</span><br/>
                  1. Farmacológico: Ketorolaco (SL)<br/>
                  2. Medidas Generales: Reposo relativo.
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="relative">
           <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-tr from-teal-500 to-indigo-500 rounded-3xl transform rotate-3 opacity-20 blur-lg"></div>
           <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1576091160399-112ba8d25d1d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80" alt="Doctor usando IA VitalScribe" class="relative rounded-3xl shadow-2xl border-4 border-white transform -rotate-2 hover:rotate-0 transition-all duration-500">
           
           <div class="absolute -bottom-6 -left-6 bg-white p-4 rounded-xl shadow-xl border border-slate-100 flex items-center gap-3 animate-bounce-slow">
             <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-green-100 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-green-600">
               <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" /></svg>
             </div>
             <div>
               <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-bold uppercase">Cumplimiento</p>
               <p class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900">NOM-004 Válida</p>
             </div>
           </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-24 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900">Tu Consultorio, Potenciado por IA</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-500 mt-4 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Diseñado por médicos y desarrolladores para eliminar la burocracia digital.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        
        <div class="p-8 rounded-3xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-100 hover:shadow-xl hover:border-teal-200 transition-all group">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-indigo-100 text-indigo-600 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl shadow-sm mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">📈</div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Inteligencia de Negocio</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">No vueles a ciegas. VitalScribe analiza tus tiempos, retención de pacientes y flujo de citas para optimizar tu rentabilidad.</p>
          <ul class="space-y-2">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-slate-500">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-teal-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
              Métricas de consulta en tiempo real
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-slate-500">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-teal-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
              Reportes de productividad
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="p-8 rounded-3xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-100 hover:shadow-xl hover:border-teal-200 transition-all group">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-teal-100 text-teal-600 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl shadow-sm mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">🔗</div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Agenda Unificada</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">Evita conflictos de horario. El sistema se fusiona con tu calendario personal y profesional para una gestión sin errores.</p>
          <div class="flex gap-3">
             <div class="flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-2 bg-white rounded-lg border border-slate-200 text-xs font-bold text-slate-600 shadow-sm">
                <span class="w-2 h-2 bg-blue-500 rounded-full"></span> G-Cal
             </div>
             <div class="flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-2 bg-white rounded-lg border border-slate-200 text-xs font-bold text-slate-600 shadow-sm">
                <span class="w-2 h-2 bg-gray-800 rounded-full"></span> iCal
             </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-8 rounded-3xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-100 hover:shadow-xl hover:border-teal-200 transition-all group relative overflow-hidden">
          <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-20 h-20 bg-orange-100 rounded-bl-full -mr-10 -mt-10 transition-transform group-hover:scale-150"></div>
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-orange-100 text-orange-600 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl shadow-sm mb-6 relative z-10 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">🗂️</div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3 relative z-10">Organización Automática</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4 relative z-10">
            Sube estudios o fotos y deja que la IA los renombre, clasifique y asigne al expediente correcto automáticamente.
          </p>
          
          <div class="bg-slate-900 p-3 rounded-lg font-mono text-[10px] text-slate-300 relative z-10">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 opacity-50 mb-1">
               <span class="text-red-400">x</span> IMG_2024_01.jpg
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-teal-400 font-bold">
               <span class="text-green-400">✓</span> Lab_Biometria_04-24.pdf
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 bg-slate-900 border-t border-slate-800">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-6">Únete a la Medicina del Futuro</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-400 mb-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Prueba VitalScribe AI sin riesgos. 15 días de acceso total para que experimentes la libertad de no escribir.
      </p>
      
      <a href={APP_URL} target="_blank" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-10 py-5 text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 transition-all duration-200 bg-teal-400 rounded-xl hover:bg-teal-300 hover:scale-105 shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(45,212,191,0.4)] gap-3">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M18 9v3m0 0v3m0-3h3m-3 0h-3m-2-5a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0zM3 20a6 6 0 0112 0v1H3v-1z" /></svg>
        Comenzar Prueba Gratuita
      </a>
      
      <p class="mt-6 text-sm text-slate-500">
        Cumplimiento NOM-004 • Seguridad Encriptada • Soporte 24/7
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>

<style>
    /* Animación personalizada para el badge */
    @keyframes bounce-slow {
        0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }
        50% { transform: translateY(-10px); }
    }
    .animate-bounce-slow {
        animation: bounce-slow 3s infinite ease-in-out;
    }
</style>